 ds_map_add(m,"You are the traveler who defeated the demond at the entrance of the city, right? some guards were talking about a traveler with blue hair and a single horn that's why I recognized you <3.","당신이 성문 앞에서 악마를 물리친 여행자죠? 경비병들에게 파란 머리에 뿔 하나가 달린 여행자 이야기를 들었거든요. 그래서 바로 알아봤어요 <3.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey, you the one with blue hair!","이봐, 파란 머리 너 말이야!");
 ds_map_add(m,"It does not appear to be in operation there is a mess inside.","영업을 안 하는 것 같아. 안쪽이 엉망이거든.");
