 ds_map_add(m,"They are in the forest south of here I ordered them to take care of an abandoned house.","이곳 남쪽 숲에 있어. 내가 그들에게 폐가를 지키라고 명령했거든.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Well this is the mission the idea is that, go and spy on two guards who previously left their position.","임무는 이거야. 전에 자리를 비웠던 경비병 두 명을 감시하는 거지.");
